  "question": {
    "text": "The probability of a bomb hitting a bridge is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> Two direct hits are needed to destroy the bridge. The minimum number of bombs required such that the probability of bridge being destroyed is greater than <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the number of bombs required <math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br />Probability of a bomb hitting the target is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Probability of atleast <math><mn>2</mn></math> hits<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mi>n</mi> </msup> <mo>−</mo><mmultiscripts> <mi>C</mi> <mprescripts></mprescripts> <none></none> <mi>n</mi> </mmultiscripts> <msub> <mrow></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msup> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </msup> <mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac> <mn>3</mn> <mn>4</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
